[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9661.83, "timestamp": "02:41:01", "text": "我很快就要去Feldcraft了，到时候看看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9663.67, "timestamp": "02:41:03", "text": "期待在那里见到你。只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9666.15, "timestamp": "02:41:06", "text": "霍格沃茨南边。顺便说一句，希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9668.95, "timestamp": "02:41:08", "text": "你用爆能枪表现不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9679.15, "timestamp": "02:41:19", "text": "你好。我们走吧，趁我们还没走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9688.03, "timestamp": "02:41:28", "text": "我们有很多装备，对吧？所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9695.79, "timestamp": "02:41:35", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9702.23, "timestamp": "02:41:42", "text": "哦好的。我们可以把剩下的所有东西都卖掉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9707.23, "timestamp": "02:41:47", "text": "[音乐]"}]